$ curl -i "http://127.0.0.1:3000/range?from=1&to=5"
HTTP/1.1 200 OK
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
content-length: 9

1,2,3,4,5

$ curl -i "http://127.0.0.1:3000/range?from=5&to=1"
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
content-length: 30

from (5) is bigger than to (1)

$ curl -i "http://127.0.0.1:3000/range?from=1"
HTTP/1.1 400 Bad Request
content-type: text/plain; charset=utf-8
content-length: 54

Failed to deserialize query string: missing field `to`
